{"name":"Desirable","hex":"#a93435","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"desirable","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Worthy to be desired; pleasing; agreeable.","Sexually attractive."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A thing that people want; something that is desirable."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/desirable"}],"entries":[{"title":"Desirable (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Desirable is a 1934 American drama film directed by Archie Mayo and starring Jean Muir and George Brent. It was released by Warner Bros. Pictures. The film follows the story of Lois, the 19-year-old daughter of a famous actress, who has been hidden away at boarding school to protect her mother's image. A scarlet-fever quarantine sends her home to New York City, full of innocent enthusiasm, only to be betrayed by her mother, by the arrogant egotists of her mother's theatrical world and by the haughty social snobs in the upper-crust family whose son her mother persuades her to marry. Mac, a friend of her mother's, initially plays an avuncular role. By the end of the film, Lois and Mac realize that they are in love."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Jean_Muir_Desireable_3_TR.jpg/330px-Jean_Muir_Desireable_3_TR.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Desirable_(film)"},{"title":"Desirable (horse)","blocks":[{"text":"Desirable was a British thoroughbred racehorse and broodmare. As a two-year-old in 1983 she won on her debut and then took the Princess Margaret Stakes on her second appearance. After finishing second in the Lowther Stakes and the Moyglare Stud Stakes she recorded her biggest victory in the Cheveley Park Stakes. In the following year she failed to win but was placed in the 1000 Guineas and the Nassau Stakes as well as finishing fourth in the Coronation Stakes and the Irish Champion Stakes. After her retirement from racing she became a very successful broodmare, producing the 1000 Guineas winner Shadayid and several other good winners."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Desirable_(horse)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Jean_Muir_Desireable_3_TR.jpg/330px-Jean_Muir_Desireable_3_TR.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Jean_Muir_Desireable_3_TR.jpg/330px-Jean_Muir_Desireable_3_TR.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJean_Muir_Desireable_3_TR.jpg"}],"sounds":{"desirable":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c2/En-us-desirable.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c2/En-us-desirable.ogg/En-us-desirable.ogg.mp3"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Veiled in Red","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/Veiled_in_Red.jpg/500px-Veiled_in_Red.jpg","ratio":0.6772247360482655,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Veiled_in_Red.jpg","share":0.28},{"title":"Soft Red Rose","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/Soft_Red_Rose.jpg/500px-Soft_Red_Rose.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Soft_Red_Rose.jpg","share":0.249375},{"title":"Two blue water meters on a matte red painted brick facade with pipes in Seoul","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/30/Two_blue_water_meters_on_a_matte_red_painted_brick_facade_with_pipes_in_Seoul.jpg/500px-Two_blue_water_meters_on_a_matte_red_painted_brick_facade_with_pipes_in_Seoul.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Two_blue_water_meters_on_a_matte_red_painted_brick_facade_with_pipes_in_Seoul.jpg","share":